                               DRIVE


Welcome to DRIVE -- the Distributed Real-time Interactive Vehicle Emulator.

DRIVE was developed to be a multi-player, client/server demonstration of
Hewlett-Packard's series 9000 Workstation 3D graphics.


INTRODUCTION
=================

DRIVE consists of two executable files, drive and drive_server, as
well as other data files and information for the program to run. 

