GETTING STARTED 
==================

DRIVE uses BSD sockets to communicate between the client and server, and
as such, requires entries in the /etc/services file in order to run.
The following entries should be in the /etc/services file of the machine
running the drive_server, as well as each machine running the drive
client.

drive        	22747/tcp       #driving simulator
drivequery	22748/udp       #driving simulator

